  "frontier_coordinate": "R-137 corrects the R-136 raw one-use interface. On a finite temporally faithful chart, every physical insertion shell has chronological rank t(k), and each forward reveal increment contains both the direct t(k)<=r triangle and the future-feedback t(k)>r triangle. A two-root filtration fixture proves the latter can be nonzero. Its six-row current is the R-079 coefficient plus derivative-feedback connection; trace, forest, low, rational, Cartan, and other signed-owner companions remain separate. R-084 supplies an exact derivative-free projected Doob norm but no spatial exponent. The existing bounded-multiplier no-go and an exact coherent-column Gram/Loewner test reject automatic spatial gain and bookkeeping cross-k orthogonality. The production owner realization, direct raw spatial estimate, future last-insertion or integrated signed substitute, once-owned q_k ledger, signed forest-current lower bound, positive finite-collar headroom, low and matching data, strict gap, absolute anchor, both A13 gates, OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, interacting measure, and Sector A remain open.",
